{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>And he loved also Rachel more than Leah.</b> What is the meaning of גם [את]? It is the way of the world: the first woman a man lies with — his love for her is fixed in his heart forever. Here too, Jacob loved Rachel when he came to her more than Leah, even though he came to Leah first — and that is the meaning of גם."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:06:38.969317574Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}